  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Twinning SWEDAC Jordanien fas 3</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU Twinning SWEDAC Jordanien fas 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SWEDAC, National accreditation body of Sweden are applying for suuport for the implementation of the EU Twinning projekt  &quot;Support the Preparation for the Negotiation of the Agreement on Conformity Assessment and Acceptance of Industrial Products (ACAA)&quot; as junior partner along with German and Austian consortie partners.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SWEDAC, Styrelsen f&#xf6;r ackreditering och teknisk kontroll ans&#xf6;ker om st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r Fas 3, genomf&#xf6;rande av EU Twinningf&#xf6;rslag till projektet &quot;Support the Preparation for the Negotiation of the Agreement on Conformity Assessment and Acceptance of Industrial Products (ACAA)&quot; som junior partner tillsammans med Tyska och &#xd6;sterrikiska konsortiepartners.</narrative>
  </description>
